CLAUDE.local.md
scratch-*.js

# --- belt and braces for a PUBLIC repo -------------------------------------
# Built packages and device binaries. `build*/` already covers where they are
# produced today; these patterns mean a stray copy anywhere else still cannot
# be committed by accident. Distributing them is forbidden (AGENTS.md, and the
# upstream licence's Nintendo rider) — this is the mechanical half of that.
*.opk
*.squashfs

# Converted game audio. The pipeline writes these from an upstream build; they
# are Nintendo-derived and must never enter the repository. They live under
# build*/ today, so this is a second lock on the same door.
*.pcm
audio/sfx/
audio/music/

# Agent worktrees and their scratch (hundreds of MB, machine-local).
.claude/
